WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Open X-TOC. Find your place. Click the extension icon to open the table of contents.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
Go straight to what matters. Jump between article sections.

00:09.000 --> 00:16.400
Keep the line that made you pause. Select a passage and save it.

00:16.400 --> 00:20.000
A good line, back in reach. Open your clip library.

00:20.000 --> 00:31.500
Give every clip a little context. Add a tag and a note, then save.

00:31.500 --> 00:37.100
Take your thinking with you. Select clips and export Markdown or JSON.

00:37.100 --> 00:40.100
X-TOC. Read with structure. Keep what matters. Available for desktop Chrome.
